     "Optionally display the vertex and propagator expressions."}], "Usage"],
  Cell["Details", "NotesSection"], Cell["The input is one diagram \
association, not the list returned by CreateDiagrams. Use CreateArrowDiagrams \
to draw a whole process.", "Notes"], Cell["The string options \
\"ShowVertexExpressions\" and \"ShowPropagatorExpressions\" default to False. \
Enable them when inspecting how model vertices and internal lines are \
assigned.", "Notes"], Cell["Displaying a diagram does not derive or validate \
its amplitude. Use diagramAmplitudes and the construction/checking tools for \
that workflow.", "Notes"], Cell["Options", "NotesSection"],
  Cell[BoxData[GridBox[{{Cell["Option", "TableHeader"],
       Cell["Default", "TableHeader"], Cell["Meaning", "TableHeader"]},
      {Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"\"ShowVertexExpressions\""}]],
           "InlineFormula"]}], "TableText"],
       Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[{"False"}]], "InlineFormula"]}],
        "TableText"], Cell["Whether drawn diagrams display the assigned \
vertex expressions. False shows the simpler topology and particle labels.",
        "TableText"]},
      {Cell[TextData[{Cell[BoxData[RowBox[
